WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.568 --> 00:00:13.813
Mrs. Rice: Oh my!

2
00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:14.893
What was that?

3
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:16.093
I knew it!

4
00:00:16.434 --> 00:00:16.914
I knew it!

5
00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:19.175
Mrs. Rice: There is a giant in there.

6
00:00:19.195 --> 00:00:21.356
Mrs. Rice: Hey!

7
00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:22.816
What's going on in there?

8
00:00:23.536 --> 00:00:23.977
Let me in.

9
00:00:23.997 --> 00:00:26.278
Mrs. Rice: There's a giant in there!

10
00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:26.918
I know it!

11
00:00:26.938 --> 00:00:31.660
Mrs. Rice: I'm going to find that giant if it's the last thing I do!

12
00:00:35.476 --> 00:00:36.577
Brad: That's not good.

13
00:00:36.597 --> 00:00:39.199
Bello: It would be all right if it were me.

14
00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:42.542
Tina: But it's not you, it's Danny.

15
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:45.324
Chuck: And it's definitely not all right!

16
00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:48.367
Danny: Oh no!

17
00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:49.728
What happened to me?

18
00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:51.649
Mrs. Rice: Let me in.

19
00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:54.011
There's a giant in there, I know it.

20
00:00:54.031 --> 00:00:56.713
Tina: Danny, Danny!

21
00:00:56.733 --> 00:00:58.835
Bello: We're down here.

22
00:00:58.855 --> 00:01:02.238
Danny: You'll have to talk louder.

23
00:01:02.959 --> 00:01:04.300
You sound like insects.

24
00:01:05.196 --> 00:01:06.637
Brad: Quick, lock the doors.

25
00:01:07.198 --> 00:01:08.739
Mrs. Rice is trying to get in.

26
00:01:08.759 --> 00:01:10.881
Mrs. Rice: Open up in there!

27
00:01:10.901 --> 00:01:12.662
Danny: Good idea.

28
00:01:13.763 --> 00:01:16.305
Tina's neighbor is starting to be a real problem.

29
00:01:16.325 --> 00:01:21.650
Mrs. I heard that!

30
00:01:21.730 --> 00:01:22.531
I heard that!

31
00:01:23.171 --> 00:01:25.673
I am going to stop you, you evil giant!

32
00:01:25.693 --> 00:01:27.775
Danny: I'm not evil!

33
00:01:27.795 --> 00:01:30.818
Mrs. Rice: It spoke to me!

34
00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:33.300
The giant spoke to me!

35
00:01:36.836 --> 00:01:38.597
Danny: There, that will stop her.

36
00:01:39.317 --> 00:01:41.158
Okay, now for the other door.

37
00:01:42.339 --> 00:01:43.400
Dave: Ahh!

38
00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:43.880
Look out.

39
00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.141
Brad: This way!

40
00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:51.845
Tina: Danny is dangerous at this size!

41
00:01:51.865 --> 00:01:57.488
Danny: There, I locked both doors.

42
00:01:58.468 --> 00:02:00.730
Bello: Danny, you're going to have to be more careful.

43
00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:03.011
Tina: You scared Brad's cat.

44
00:02:03.031 --> 00:02:04.952
Dave: You scared us too!

45
00:02:09.156 --> 00:02:10.997
Danny: I can't believe what happened to me.

46
00:02:11.638 --> 00:02:12.859
How did it go wrong, Brad?

47
00:02:12.879 --> 00:02:16.081
Danny: I thought you said the shrink-gun would work this time.

48
00:02:16.861 --> 00:02:17.742
Bello: But it did work.

49
00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:20.604
Dave: It worked a little too well, that's all.

50
00:02:20.624 --> 00:02:22.645
Brad: Don't worry, Danny.

51
00:02:23.125 --> 00:02:24.186
We'll figure it out.

52
00:02:24.947 --> 00:02:25.847
Chuck: Bello is right.

53
00:02:26.247 --> 00:02:27.408
The shrink-gun worked.

54
00:02:28.169 --> 00:02:29.610
It did unshrink Danny.

55
00:02:29.650 --> 00:02:33.052
Tina: Danny had nano-putty all over his clothes.

56
00:02:33.953 --> 00:02:35.734
Maybe that's why he's so big.

57
00:02:35.754 --> 00:02:38.716
Brad: And remember, water fell on me.

58
00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:40.881
It might have caused the problem.

59
00:02:40.901 --> 00:02:43.482
Bello: Is the shrink-gun broken?

60
00:02:43.502 --> 00:02:45.143
Brad: It looks okay.

61
00:02:45.944 --> 00:02:47.444
I wish I had my computer.

62
00:02:47.464 --> 00:02:49.606
Tina: Where is it?

63
00:02:50.226 --> 00:02:52.127
Brad: I left it behind at the mites' fort.

64
00:02:52.147 --> 00:02:56.069
Brad: If I had it, I could use it to adjust the shrink-gun perfectly.

65
00:02:56.089 --> 00:02:58.870
Dave: I think we should just try it again.

66
00:02:58.890 --> 00:03:00.171
Bello: Yes.

67
00:03:00.231 --> 00:03:02.272
We should try to get Danny back to normal.

68
00:03:02.913 --> 00:03:04.874
Brad: Okay, let me dry it off first.

69
00:03:05.454 --> 00:03:08.776
Chuck: I really hope it works this time.

70
00:03:10.556 --> 00:03:11.639
Tina: Get ready, Danny.

71
00:03:12.482 --> 00:03:14.427
Brad's going to try the shrink-gun again.

72
00:03:14.447 --> 00:03:17.375
Danny: Okay, I'm ready when you are.
